<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Add a store - Monokulo</title>
{{> styles}}
</head>
<body>
{{> nav}}
<div class="wrap">

<h1>Add a store</h1>
<p>Choose the setup that matches your storefront.</p>

<div class="pick-grid">
<div class="pick-card">
<h3>Simple &rarr; WooCommerce</h3>
<p>Running WordPress + WooCommerce? Install the plugin and click Connect - no keys to paste in
by hand.</p>
<a class="btn" href="/dashboard/connections/new/woocommerce">Set up WooCommerce</a>
</div>
<div class="pick-card">
<h3>Custom (advanced)</h3>
<p>Integrating something else, or want full control over the wallet material yourself? Paste in
your own watch-only key pair directly.</p>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/dashboard/connect">Advanced setup</a>
</div>
</div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
